     1,
     "PyStan 0.1.1 is up on the Python Package Index (Python&#39;s CRAN).\r<br>\r<br><a href=\"https://pypi.python.org/pypi/pystan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://pypi.python.org/pypi/pystan&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792476065094000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1fsBALp36vMsDFZWhrEkSE\">https://pypi.python.org/pypi/pystan</a>\r<br>\r<br>Sampling works fine under Python 2.7 and Python 3.3. It&#39;s still alpha though;\r<br>there are a number of things to be implemented, such as reading/writing to csv. \r<br>\r<br>Useful links:\r<br>\r<br>- Source code repo: <a href=\"https://github.com/ariddell/pystan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/ariddell/pystan&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792476065094000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0xfMvA-Qhcxl4Jw6MVVel7\">https://github.com/ariddell/pystan</a>\r<br>- HTML documentation: <a href=\"http://pystan.readthedocs.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://pystan.readthedocs.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792476065094000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0K1BdcDGYpGauCo_8-CXLv\">http://pystan.readthedocs.org</a>\r<br>- Issue tracker: <a href=\"https://github.com/ariddell/pystan/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/ariddell/pystan/issues&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792476065094000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3h6cFuM62db350fDB3Y-3l\">https://github.com/ariddell/pystan/issues</a>\r<br>"
