     "I&#39;m having some trouble. I eventually got python3 versions of all the dependencies installed, which allowed it to build<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">running install_egg_info<br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Writing</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">usr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#008\">local</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lib</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">python3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dist</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pystan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.egg</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">info<br>running install_clib<br>creating </span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">usr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#008\">local</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lib</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">python3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dist</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pystan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bin<br>copying build</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color: