yle=\"color:#066\">56</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">31</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">GCC </span><span style=\"color:#066\">4.8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> on linux<br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Type</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;help&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;copyright&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;credits&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">or</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;license&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> more information</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;&gt;&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">import</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> pystan<br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Traceback</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">most recent call </span><span style=\"color:#008\">last</span><span style=\"color:#660\">):</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">File</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&lt;stdin&gt;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> line </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=